    "measurementTechnique": [
      "iButton temperature sensors were deployed on the sediment surface inside a protective metal covering and held in place with stakes or rocks at up to seven locations at each river. OUT iButtons were deployed with the intention to never be inundated by the river. IN iButtons were deployed with the intention to always be inundated by the river, but in some cases rivers went dry during the deployment. The remaining five iButtons were intentionally deployed in variably inundated regions of sediment in a transect spanning upstream (U), Upstream Mid-Point (UM), Mid-Stream (M), Downstream Mid-Point (DM), and Downstream (D) locations. See iButton_Deployment_Protocol.pdf in the data package for more detail.",
      "The WHONDRS Consortium includes the following co-authors who supported sample collection: Scott Brooks (Oak Ridge National Laboratory; 0000-0002-8437-9788); John Campbell (USDA Forest Service; 0000-0003-4956-1696); James Coloso (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0003-3114-5862); Walter Dodds (Kansas State University; 0000-0002-6666-8930); Brandon Forsythe (Pennsylvania State University; 0000-0001-9780-212X); Daniel Kaplan (Savannah River National Laboratory; 0000-0002-1019-8386); Richard Lehrter (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0002-5760-9269); Kenneth Lowe (Oak Ridge National Laboratory; 0000-0003-4680-4330); William McDowell (University of New Hampshire; 0000-0002-8739-9047); Christof Meile (University of Georgia; 0000-0002-0825-4596); Josh Monroe (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0003-1651-3911); Alexander Newman (Rocky Mountain Biological Laboratory; 0000-0002-1574-8754); Ingrid Ortiz Gonzalez (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0003-1220-2331); Melissa Petty (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0002-9463-8595); Samuel Pierce (SLAC National Accelerator Laboratory; 0000-0001-7614-0227); Andrew Robison (University of New Hampshire; 0000-0003-1628-6237); Dontrece Smith (GCE-LTER/University of Georgia); Emily Stanley (University of Wisconsin-Madison; 0000-0003-4922-8121); Carl Trettin (USDA Forest Service; 0000-0003-0279-7191); David Van Horn (University of New Mexico); Maria Viggiano (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0002-4299-7043); David Weed (Michigan State University; 0000-0002-4545-4992); Christopher Whitney (University of New Hampshire); Ryan Williams (Battelle Memorial Institute - National Ecological Observatory Network; 0000-0003-4958-6412); Wilfred Wollheim (University of New Hampshire; 0000-0002-5009-3212); Kyle Zollo-Venecek (University of New Hampshire; 0000-0002-1615-590X)."
    ],
